# ZimaOS Service Restoration Plan

Following the fresh format of ZimaOS to version 1.4.4, we need to restore the connectivity and applications.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The ZimaOS device is currently reachable via IPv6 at `zimaos.local` port 80, but the IPv4 address `192.168.1.44` is not responding. Please verify if the IP has changed or if DHCP is still assigning it.

## Proposed Changes

### 1. ZimaOS Internet / DNS Fix (Turkey Specific)
The "Unable to access Docker Hub" error is usually caused by DNS issues. We will apply the same fix as before.
- **Action**: Set system DNS and Docker DNS to `1.1.1.1` and `8.8.8.8`.

### 2. Application Deployment
We will re-deploy the core services using the existing scripts in the `casaos-home-server` repository.
- **Casatozima (Flask App)**: Re-deploy the localized dashboard.
- **IT Inventory**: Restore the inventory management service.

## Verification Plan

